<Layout title="How Vankard works"><section class="page-hero grid-paper"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h1>From a passing visit<br/>to a <em>useful conversation.</em></h1><p>Not another tool for your team to babysit.<br/>A managed sales layer, built around your business.</p></section><section class="section"><Demo/></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>We build the layer.<br/><em>You keep the context.</em></h2><p>Recover is the starting point.<br/>Here is what implementation looks like.</p></div><div class="timeline">{[['Understand your offer','We map your services, buying questions, qualification criteria and the next steps your team can actually deliver.'],['Write the conversations','We create offer-specific scripts and useful answers. Human escalation is planned before the first visitor needs it.'],['Install and connect','Vanka is installed and your CRM connection is configured. The 48-hour installation window starts after access and approvals are ready.'],['Tune with real conversations','For 14 days after launch, we tune the experience around how visitors respond. Your morning brief keeps the important context visible.']].map(([t,d],i)=><article><span>0{i+1}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></article>)}</div></section><section class="section split"><h2>A visitor is a person.<br/><em>Not a pop-up target.</em></h2><div><p>Good conversations need relevance. Vanka’s role is to help people understand the offer and choose an appropriate next step.</p><p>Some visitors need an answer. Some need a meeting. Some are not a fit. The experience should make each of those outcomes clearer.</p><a href="/demo/" class="text-link">Explore the demonstration ↗</a></div></section><CTA/></Layout>
